'''Ice Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases her damage, range and chance to freeze [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

