==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Ice Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Dynamites (Removed Combo)|Dynamites]].
*Prior to [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]], Ice Crystal Cat was one of the few [[:Category:Cats with Ultra Talents|Cats with Ultra Talents]] to lack a second [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] slot.
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Ice Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Ice Cat
A Cat that was entranced by a girl
hailing from the Land of Ice. It is frozen.
Might freeze Red enemies. (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>Ice Queen Cat
Forgot to mention that the Cat is an
eternal icicle. Don't think it complains much.
Might freeze Red enemies. (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>Ice Crystal Cat
The Ice Queen's reign grows more secure,
and so does her Cat companion's crystal shell.
Freezes Red enemies in place (Area Attack).</pre>
*Ice Cat is the unit shown on the [[Catfruit]] evolution tutorial.
**Notably, the required quantities shown in the example image for Purple (5), Red (10), Blue (4) and Epic Catfruit (5) are higher than what they currently are in-game.
*Although Ice Cat was added in Version 2.0, she was inaccessible until [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]] fully implemented THE DYNAMITES set.
*Ice Cat's Freeze duration was improved from 2 seconds to 4 in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.6 Update|Version 2.0.6]].
*Ice Cat's Range was increased from 300 to 325 in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]]

